{"id":"1d99e4b5d113","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universities-interested","lang":"en","title":"Universities interested in collaborating with USI","description":"Are you considering collaborating with Università della Svizzera italiana (USI)? Below is a collection of documents and resources to help you discover the unique characteristics of our university and the reasons why USI could be the right partner for you.","section":"International Relations","crumbs":["International Relations","Specific information for:"],"image":null,"words":170,"alternates":{"it":"/it/universita/info/relint/informazioni-specifiche/universita-interessate","en":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universities-interested"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"International Relations","path":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Specific information for:","path":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"Universities interested in collaborating with USI","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"html","html":"<p>Are you considering collaborating with Università della Svizzera italiana (USI)?</p> <p>Below is a collection of documents and resources to help you discover the unique characteristics of our university and the reasons why USI could be the right partner for you.</p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Become an USI partner university"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>The publication <a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/relint/relint-partner-with-usi.pdf\">&quot;Partner with USI&quot;</a> showcases the Università della Svizzera italiana by highlighting its strengths and distinctive qualities, which we believe could inspire you to consider a collaboration with us.</p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Factsheet"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>Lugano Campus</p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/relint/relint-fact-sheet-2026-2027-lugano.pdf\">Fact Sheet Lugano Campus 2026-2027</a></li> </ul> <p>Mendrisio Campus </p> <ul> <li><a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/relint/relint-fact-sheet-2025-2026-arc.pdf\">Fact Sheet Mendrisio Campus 2025-2026</a></li> </ul>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Statistics and Rankings"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>Key figures can be viewed here: <a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/exchange/figures\">https://www.usi.ch/en/university/who-we-are/facts-and-figures/overview</a></p> <p>Data relating to mobility is available at the following link: <a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/exchange/figures\">https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/relint/exchange/figures</a></p> <p>USI features in numerous international rankings. For further information, please refer to the <a href=\"/en/university/who-we-are/facts-and-figures/rankings\">dedicated page</a>.</p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Annual report"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>The annual reports (in Italian only) are available here: <a href=\"/en/university/info/relint/annual-report\">https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/relint/annual-report</a></p>"},{"t":"h","level":2,"text":"Request for a visit/delegation"},{"t":"html","html":"<p>We look forward to welcoming you! Kindly complete the following <a href=\"https://content.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/relint/relint-request_form_for_a_visit.pdf\">form</a> and sent it to <a href=\"mailto:relint@usi.ch\">relint@usi.ch</a> at least 4 weeks before the planned date of your visit. </p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"International Relations and Study Abroad","href":"/en/university/info/relint"},{"label":"Governance","href":"/en/universita/info/relint/governance"},{"label":"Strategy and objectives 2025-2028","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/internationalization-strategy-goals"},{"label":"International relations commission","href":"/en/university/info/relint/commission"},{"label":"International collaborations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/international-relations/partnerships"},{"label":"Annual report","href":"/en/university/info/relint/annual-report"},{"label":"Statistical data","href":"/en/university/info/relint/exchange/figures"},{"label":"All categories","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information"},{"label":"USI students","href":"/en/university/info/relint/usi-student"},{"label":"Incoming exchanges","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-exchange-students"},{"label":"Incoming internships","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-mobility-for-internship"},{"label":"InclUSIone","href":"/en/university/info/relint/inclusione"},{"label":"ESKAS scholarship holders","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/swiss-government-excellence-scholarships"},{"label":"Scholars at Risk","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/scholars-at-risk-network"},{"label":"USI academic staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/academic-staff"},{"label":"USI staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/administrative-staff"},{"label":"Incoming academic body","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-academic-staff"},{"label":"Incoming staff","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/incoming-staff-mobilities"},{"label":"Visiting researchers","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/visiting-researchers"},{"label":"External organisations","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/external-organizations"},{"label":"Partner universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universita-partner"},{"label":"Interested universities","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universities-interested"},{"label":"Internationalisation at home - I@H","href":"/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/internationalization-at-home"},{"label":"\"Come and Go\" newsletter","href":"/en/university/info/relint/come-go-archive"},{"label":"Events","href":"/en/university/info/relint/events"},{"label":"Il mondo in USI","href":"/en/university/info/relint/il-mondo-in-usi"},{"label":"News","href":"/en/university/info/relint/news"},{"label":"Team and contacts","href":"/en/university/info/relint/team"},{"label":"2005-2025: 20 years of activity","href":"/en/university/info/relint/20-years-of-activity"}],"links":[{"label":"Request form for visit/delegation (PDF 100.83 KB)","href":"/sites/default/files/storage/attachments/relint-request_form_for_a_visit.pdf"}],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/university/info/relint/specific-information/universities-interested","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T17:58:37.348Z"}